description: AutoGarage follows the supplied seven-layer Java architecture
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and docs/CODING_GUIDELINES.md before changes.
Use common/ and feature controller/dto/request/dto/response/entity/mapper/repository/service/impl.
Ordinary entities extend BaseEntity, use LAZY relationships and never @Data.
Use MapStruct spring mappers, JpaRepository/JPQL/Pageable and Service/ServiceImpl.
Use Lombok RequiredArgsConstructor, private final dependencies and ServiceImpl transactions.
Use implemented Audited annotations for important writes, ApiPaths/SecurityConstants and per-method RBAC.
Use numeric ResponseCode, BusinessException and ApiResponse(code,message,success,data,timestamp,path).
Use Swagger Tag/Operation; validate DTOs and object ownership, never expose entity credentials.
Test Mockito/InjectMocks/AssertJ, H2 integration, and MySQL for native queries/locking/migrations.
Preserve published migrations and secrets; report actual test/build results.
